  "details": "right now a trainee either has power or just watches, what if you could approve what a trainee does before it actually happens?\n\nWhy\n\ntrainees are new staff, so they may make some mistakes, and it's up to their superior to correct them and tell them what's wrong and what's good, so why not help this process by making it safer for booth trainee and group?\n\nHow\n\nwhen a role has the \"Trainee Mode\" if they try to ban, or kick, if there is a staff member that is not a trainee (so a full staff member) but they have the full permissions to ban or kick, then the full staff member will be able to approve the action such as ban or kick and the log will say something among the lines \"Traineename has issued an instance kick for Nociveusername and was approved by Staffname.\"\n\nExample\n\nNociveusername breaks the rules\n\nTraineename kicks them\n\nStaffname approves the kick\n\nNociveusername gets kicked from the instance",
